              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Wele alaka ali, “Liloba lirusie bie bulamu khuloondekhana ne chingano chabio, chikhaafu ne bibiindu bimoola ne chisaang'i che mundaa ne chisolo khuloondekhana ne chingano chacho.” Mala kaba kario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele akhola chisaang'i che mundaa ne chisolo khuloondekhana ne chingano chacho, ne chikhaafu khuloondekhana ne chingano chacho, nende buli sisiindu simoola asi khuloondekhana ne lukano lwasio. Mala Wele abona ali bwaba bulayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
